MONO Finance

E-money card scan (src/features/nfc): protocol notes consulted
------------------------------------------------------------
The byte sequences the card adapters send and the way their answers are laid out were written from the public
descriptions of these projects. No source code was copied or translated from any of them; the adapters and their parsers
are original, and every conversation in the tests is made up.

- muhakmal/osp-kue-reader (Apache License 2.0): README, for the Mandiri application names and the Flazz generation 1
  limits.
- machfudn/tapMoney (GNU GPL v3): README only, as a description of the protocol (application names, read commands, the
  order of the bytes of an answer). Nothing of its code is used.
- dwierwink/scannertest (no licence stated): README and its algorithm notes, as a description of the protocol.

Each adapter's header comment says which facts came from where, and which of them are not confirmed by a second source.
